SRR10359752	PRJNA580234	SRP227348	SAMN13152820	SRX7069153	Mus musculus	HC3_lo	HC3_lo	Illumina HiSeq 2000 sequencing: GSM4143495: HC3_lo Mus musculus RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	PAIRED	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2000	Primary microglia were isolated by gentle dounce homogenization of the brain, Percoll-based myelin removal, and FACS-purification of ~10,000 live CD11b+CD45lo cells. BODIPYlo (=lipid droplet-low) and BODIPYhi (=lipid droplet-high) microglia were sorted into RLT Plus buffer (Qiagen) containing beta-mercaptoethanol. RNA was extracted using a RNeasy Micro Plus kit (Qiagen) according to the manufacturer's protocol. cDNA synthesis and amplification was performed using the SmartSeq v4 Ultra-low input kit (Takara), and libraries were tagmented, adaptor ligated, and indexed using the Nextera XT kit (Illumina).	33605098	6788229796	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR103/052/SRR10359752/SRR10359752_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR103/052/SRR10359752/SRR10359752_2.fastq.gz	c9835b319d272aac5e822c5b6318b806;5f2cb15eff2eca8bb636ee7c0ac65214	2661161697;2735568036
